All the cool kids are having meetups, and Eidolos hasn't been to Mary's,
so I am calling one for the Boston area. If you don't live near Boston,
well, "why not?" Also, if you keep reading this post, don't blame me 
for it not having content that interests you. :)

Since this is (to my knowledge) the first one, I'm arbitrarily choosing
a place and time. Mary Chung's restaurant in Cambridge ("the other
Cambridge") is a big geek hangout and has excellent food --- plus,
for those of you playing the evening foodless, there's wine and beer.
(There are also plenty of vegetarian and vegan options.) Plus, the 
waitstaff know me and don't mind if I show up with fifteen people as
long as I tell them in advance.

Mary Chung's Restaurant
464 Massachusetts Avenue
Cambridge MA 02142
7:30 PM, 7/29/06 

