BY CAR:

Use Google Maps. Google is good for something. There are a couple of
parking lots across the street; you have to go off Mass Ave a block to
get them. There's some on-street metered parking that should be free by
that time in the evening. 

BY BIKE:

Avoid Prospect street, it will kill your tires or your wrists, whichever
are weaker. Ample parking right in front of the restaurant.

BY TRAIN:

Take the Red Line to Central Square and walk south about two
blocks. Mary's is on your right. If you hit Economy Hardware, you went
too far. If you hit City Hall, you went in the wrong direction.



